  {
    "description": "List the pull requests this conversation has already opened with the repository-edit tools editRepo and editDbtProject (its "workstreams"), so you can decide where a change should go. Use this before editRepo / editDbtProject when the user asks to change a repo you may have an open pull request on already: read the list, then either pass an existing pull request URL as the edit tool's \`prUrl\` to continue that one, or set \`startNewPullRequest\` to open a separate pull request. Returns each workstream as owner/repo with its pull request URL, number, and a short summary. Optionally filter to a single repository. Read-only.",
